'''Aether Foundation Employees''' (Japanese: '''エーテル財団 職員''' ''Aether Foundation Staff'')  are employees of the [[Aether Foundation]] dressed in white, futuristic uniforms. They are part of the {{tc|Aether Foundation}} [[Trainer class]].

The {{player}} battles the Employees while raiding [[Aether Paradise]] in search of the kidnapped [[Lillie]]. During this sequence, the Employees act and look villainous when battled, acting similarly to the [[Grunt]]s of [[villainous team]]s. In addition to the traditional male and female variants, the player will also battle masked scientist Employees in the Foundation's secret lab. Most of the Employees keep their Pokémon in [[Great Ball]]s, although scientist Employees use [[Repeat Ball]]s instead.

Most other Employees are battled outside of the main storyline at the [[Battle Tree]] and [[Battle Royal Dome]]. The Aether Foundation Trainers at the Battle Royal Dome exclusively use {{t|Water}}- and {{type|Grass}} {{OBP|Pokémon|species}}; however, those at the Battle Tree do not appear to specialize in anything. These Employees are friendly and are truer to the ideals of the Aether Foundation.

